{# Mira interview shows — approval + booking link. Live send is the Worker's inline
   copy (triage-decision handler); keep in sync if you edit tone. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Thank you for applying. I'd love to have you on {{ show_name }}. Pick a time
  that works for you here, booking with this email address so everything
  reaches you:</p>
  <p><a href="{{ booking_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ booking_url }}</a></p>
  <p>We talk from a computer browser with headphones or earbuds on; there is
  nothing to install. It runs about forty-five minutes, it's recorded, and
  nothing publishes until you have heard it and approved it.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
